  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, Friday, <date when="1812-06-19">June 19, 1812</date>,<lb/>
               Will be perform'd a Play in Three Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title><hi rend="allcaps">Iron Chest.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Edward Mortimer,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Terry</hi>.</actor><lb/>
                  (being his First appearance in that Character.)</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Captain Fitzharding,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Wilford,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Adam Winterton,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Rawbold,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grant</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Samson Rawbold,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bennett</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Servants,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi></actor> and <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Armstrong,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kent</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Orson,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Betterton,</hi> Jun.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Robbers,</role> Messrs. <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Dalton</hi>,</actor> <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Villiers</hi>,</actor> <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Glenville</hi>,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/> 
                  <castItem><role>Helen,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Glover</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Barbara,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Atkins</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dame Rawbold,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Kendall.</hi></actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Judith,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Blanch,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which,<lb/>
               (<hi rend="allcaps">Fifth Time</hi>)<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">A New Farce</hi>, in Two Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Sleep-Walker;</title><lb/>
                  Or, Which is the Lady?</bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="allcaps">The Principal Characters By</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mathews</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kent</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bennett</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chippendale</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Dalton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi> <measure type="currency">5s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi> <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Second Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.<lb/>
               The New Farce of the <hi rend="allcaps">Sleep-Walker</hi> having been last night,<lb/>
               again received with the loudest bursts of laughter throughout, will be<lb/>
               repeated every evening 'till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
